    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "设点M在直角边AC（不包括端点）上，连接BM，则 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\angle B M A > \\angle C , \\angle B M A"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "是钝角.若过点M且垂直于BM的直线与线段AB相交于点 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "M ^ { \\prime }"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "则有 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "A B { > } B M ^ { \\prime } { > } B M"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "，设点N在线段CA的延长线上，连接BN，同理可得 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "B N { > } A B"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "．因此，在射线CA上，与点B的连线长度等于AB的点只有一个.再由点 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "A ^ { \\prime }"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "在射线CA上， "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "A ^ { \\prime } B ^ { \\prime } { = } A B"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "，可知点"
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "A ^ { \\prime }"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "与点A重合.这样， "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\triangle A ^ { \\prime } B ^ { \\prime } C ^ { \\prime }"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "的三个顶点与"
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\triangle A B C"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "的三个顶点分别重合， "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\triangle A ^ { \\prime } B ^ { \\prime } C ^ { \\prime }"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "与 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\triangle A B C"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "能够完全重合，因而 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\triangle A ^ { \\prime } B ^ { \\prime } C ^ { \\prime } { \\overset { \\sim } { = } } \\triangle A B C"
          }
        ]
      },
